### Summary of Test Coverage
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
###
### ✅ 1. Wallet top-up ( prerequisite)
### ✅ 2. Create order - happy path (primary address)
### ✅ 3. Create order - insufficient balance (400)
### ✅ 4. Create order - no address (400) - requires setup
### ✅ 5. Get order history
### ✅ 6. Get order by ID - owner (200)
### ✅ 7. Get order by ID - wrong user (403)
### ✅ 8. Meal price calculation
### ✅ 9. Kitchen dashboard - admin only (200)
###
### DB Verification Points:
### - orders table: new row with correct UserMealId, DeliveryAddressId
### - wallet_transactions table: debit entry with correct amount
### - wallet balance: correctly reduced by order total
### - user_meals table: ingredients linked to order
